#: ../../tools/ncbi_sra_tools.rst:32 73e975fd30d8497bafac0e0a32a4c12a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get FTP and cloud storage URLs for downloading FASTQ "
"sequencing data from SRA runs. Returns multiple access methods: NCBI FTP "
"URLs for direct .sra file download, AWS S3 URLs for cloud-based access "
"(faster for large-scale analysis), and NCBI web URLs for browser access. "
"Note: Downloaded .sra files require SRA Toolkit (fastq-dump or fasterq-"
"dump) to convert to standard FASTQ format. Essential for programmatic "
"access to petabytes of public sequencing data. Works with SRR (NCBI), ERR"
" (ENA), and DRR (DDBJ) accessions."
msgstr ""

